  "no_colors_cause": "The palette asset /Game/Data/Palettes/DA_Primary was never cooked into the packaged build: Config/DefaultGame.ini had bCookAll=False and only /Game/Data/Effects in DirectoriesToAlwaysCook, so the asset in /Game/Data/Palettes was excluded. At runtime LoadObject fails (log: 'Couldn't find file for package /Game/Data/Palettes/DA_Primary' and 'Palette is null, using fallback gray'), so the HUD paints everything gray. It works in the editor because the editor sees uncooked content directly. Fix: add +DirectoriesToAlwaysCook=(Path=\"/Game/Data/Palettes\") to DefaultGame.ini."
}

